{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、私の20の誕生日でした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのお祝いの言葉をいただき、とても幸せな一日でした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3XR5YVN8KM5J16067A2KR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nピンクの花束❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマの方たちから、いただいたお花とプレゼントです!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3XSJ25TD3D8YTNWYJC8RE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中身はなんと･･･"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つや姫!!!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3XVBTSC7KDGPYSG4SE8N8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n大好きな新種のお米です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なつかしいなあ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3XWS6R57YJHR36X8SJ5HQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nとーっても美味しいお米とパシャリ。\nつや姫は、粒が立っていてツヤツヤしていて程よい硬さのお米です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山形で1番好きなお米です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして葵からはポップコーンを貰いました!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3XZDEV8EGK9BP403GC1FG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nずっと食べたかったポップコーン!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味は、\nチーズとキャラメルのシカゴmix♡\n朝からぺろりと食べてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマの方々からのケーキ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3Y12SJCFEDVJDFXQ67DFZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n木の葉型りんごが!!\nなーこって書いてある〜嬉しいヽ(;▽;)ノ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達から、人生初のキルフェボンのケーキ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3Y2QT3R6ZQYH1WPQNNZHW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも沢山ケーキとお菓子をいただきました〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せ幸せ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日続けばいいのに!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は20歳なので、健康管理に気をつけてバリバリの20代になろうと思います(`・ω´・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうか支えて下さいm(*_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}